      "titleZh": "智能体时代AI选择指南",
      "titleEn": "A Guide to Which AI to Use in the Agentic Era",
      "summaryZh": "本文来自One Useful Thing，指出在智能体时代，AI的选择不再仅限于聊天机器人，而是需要根据任务类型、自主性和成本等因素进行综合考量。文章提供了选择AI的实用指南，帮助用户在不同场景下做出明智决策。",
      "summaryEn": "This article from One Useful Thing points out that in the agentic era, AI selection is no longer limited to chatbots, but requires comprehensive consideration of factors such as task type, autonomy, and cost. It provides a practical guide to help users make informed decisions in different scenarios.",
